-- +goose Up
-- owner: R8 player data (A-037)
-- R8-2: every table whose JSON payload the code decodes into a Go value gets payload_version (docs/data/PAYLOAD_COLUMNS.json,
-- decode struct or map). The version is a column so payload bytes, digests and fingerprints never change. Existing rows
-- are version 0 (lenient decode, unknown keys logged); writers store foundation/payload.Current. One version covers
-- every decoded column of a table. Metadata-only: a constant default rewrites no rows.

